1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,320
Good morning everyone. This is the weekly engineering sync for Project Nimbus.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,460
Today is Thursday, and we have four items on the agenda.

3
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:17,520
The Kubernetes migration, the PostgreSQL latency issue, the Q3 OKRs, and the hiring update.

4
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,920
Priya, do you want to start with the migration?

5
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:28,520
Sure, thanks Marcus. So the Kubernetes migration is about 70% done.

6
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:35,160
We moved the authentication service, and the billing service to the new EKS cluster last week.

7
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,140
The main blocker right now is the Redis cache.

8
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:46,200
When we deployed it with Helm, the persistent volume claims were failing, because of a misconfigured storage class.

9
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:53,320
I opened a ticket, Jira number NIM-482, and I expect it to be fixed by Tuesday.

10
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:58,980
Okay, good. Do we need anything from the DevOps team?
